  "method": "Read fresh native 1x QEMU frames before and after running Queue Desk. Reconstruct all three task records from the first F5 head and two shutdown records from the second, and match final serial output. Extract and execute the exact whole-head verdict statements from each named checker on all captured pages. Erase only the last displayed hex digit in every original frame that shows it, then repeat. Separate failed-start guests used the same kernel with a one-digit mismatch in the expected measurement and the Surfbird application from the tester ISO.",
